1
00:00:16,534 --> 00:00:22,869
(Firefly Theater)

2
00:00:43,456 --> 00:00:47,392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

3
00:00:49,024 --> 00:00:52,608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

4
00:00:53,184 --> 00:00:55,520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

5
00:00:55,904 --> 00:00:58,656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

6
00:00:59,488 --> 00:01:02,080
♪I've seen this game before♪

7
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

8
00:01:04,768 --> 00:01:07,168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

9
00:01:07,552 --> 00:01:10,304
♪Just an empty shell♪

10
00:01:10,624 --> 00:01:13,440
♪I've broken this game before♪

11
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:15,872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

12
00:01:15,872 --> 00:01:18,016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

13
00:01:18,208 --> 00:01:25,056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

14
00:01:25,728 --> 00:01:28,256
♪When I stand back up again♪

15
00:01:28,544 --> 00:01:30,400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

16
00:01:31,264 --> 00:01:33,952
♪For the part you owe me♪

17
00:01:34,112 --> 00:01:41,088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

18
00:01:42,624 --> 00:01:47,360
♪You're just my starting point♪

19
00:01:51,712 --> 00:01:52,739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

20
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,720
=Episode 13=

21
00:01:58,276 --> 00:01:58,717
Mom,

22
00:01:58,996 --> 00:02:00,356
why did you take my bag?

23
00:02:05,597 --> 00:02:06,196
Mom,

24
00:02:06,877 --> 00:02:08,277
have you really lost your mind?

25
00:02:09,796 --> 00:02:10,157
Fine.

26
00:02:10,837 --> 00:02:11,277
I'll tell you

27
00:02:11,277 --> 00:02:12,317
everything today.

28
00:02:12,837 --> 00:02:13,916
Do you know why that scammer

29
00:02:14,117 --> 00:02:14,756
knew so much

30
00:02:14,796 --> 00:02:15,756
about our family?

31
00:02:16,397 --> 00:02:16,997
Because that scammer

32
00:02:17,076 --> 00:02:18,076
is part of our family!

33
00:02:20,117 --> 00:02:21,157
Di Liren wasn't just

34
00:02:21,236 --> 00:02:22,277
simply flirting

35
00:02:22,317 --> 00:02:23,236
or slacking off.

36
00:02:23,476 --> 00:02:24,356
He's having an affair.

37
00:02:25,037 --> 00:02:26,277
He's trying to scam our family

38
00:02:26,356 --> 00:02:27,476
and siphon off our assets.

39
00:02:28,076 --> 00:02:29,476
And that's not even the worst part.

40
00:02:29,756 --> 00:02:30,837
The worst part is

41
00:02:30,997 --> 00:02:32,076
he was married before,

42
00:02:32,196 --> 00:02:33,317
and his ex-wife is none other

43
00:02:33,437 --> 00:02:34,397
than our housekeeper,

44
00:02:34,476 --> 00:02:34,916
Lu Hui!

45
00:02:35,037 --> 00:02:35,916
That's impossible.

46
00:02:36,317 --> 00:02:37,236
Are you sure about this?

47
00:02:37,717 --> 00:02:38,317
Lu Hui?

48
00:02:38,756 --> 00:02:39,597
There's no way.

49
00:02:39,837 --> 00:02:40,676
You don't believe me?

50
00:02:41,196 --> 00:02:42,476
Fine, I'll show you the photos.

51
00:02:42,956 --> 00:02:44,037
I don't want to see them.

52
00:02:44,356 --> 00:02:45,997
Everything online is fake.

53
00:02:46,317 --> 00:02:47,037
I won't listen.

54
00:02:47,476 --> 00:02:48,437
I must stay grounded.

55
00:02:51,476 --> 00:02:52,076
Mom,

56
00:02:52,756 --> 00:02:54,117
you're really driving me crazy!

57
00:02:55,196 --> 00:02:55,636
I found it.

58
00:02:56,037 --> 00:02:56,756
Xiuyuan's account

59
00:02:56,756 --> 00:02:57,476
was sold not long ago,

60
00:02:57,597 --> 00:02:58,837
around Mr. Yu's hospitalization.

61
00:02:59,236 --> 00:03:00,236
Di Liren probably started

62
00:03:00,236 --> 00:03:00,997
setting up then.

63
00:03:01,796 --> 00:03:02,837
I'm on my way to you.

64
00:03:03,196 --> 00:03:03,956
Stay calm.

65
00:03:13,956 --> 00:03:15,676
Mr. Di, what a coincidence.

66
00:03:15,916 --> 00:03:17,117
I'm picking up Yu Meng too.

67
00:03:19,356 --> 00:03:20,676
Liu Zi asked me

68
00:03:21,196 --> 00:03:22,676
to make sure she gets

69
00:03:23,076 --> 00:03:24,236
home safely.

70
00:03:29,597 --> 00:03:30,756
That scoundrel Di Liren.

71
00:03:31,037 --> 00:03:31,557
He and Lu Hui

72
00:03:31,557 --> 00:03:32,476
have no bottom line.

73
00:03:32,877 --> 00:03:33,796
They found a fake mystic

74
00:03:33,837 --> 00:03:34,516
to brainwash my mom

75
00:03:34,636 --> 00:03:35,317
and set her up.

76
00:03:36,117 --> 00:03:38,236
Those two are completely unscrupulous.

77
00:03:38,437 --> 00:03:39,997
Who could've seen this coming?

78
00:03:40,117 --> 00:03:41,756
Now the shareholder meeting

79
00:03:42,196 --> 00:03:43,397
is a total bust.

80
00:03:43,796 --> 00:03:45,037
Before my mom went up the mountain,

81
00:03:45,157 --> 00:03:46,196
she texted Mr. Tian

82
00:03:46,317 --> 00:03:47,236
and made herself clear.

83
00:03:47,636 --> 00:03:48,277
She said

84
00:03:48,397 --> 00:03:49,837
she'll stay away from power struggles

85
00:03:49,916 --> 00:03:50,837
and worldly affairs,

86
00:03:51,157 --> 00:03:52,916
devoting herself to praying for my dad.

87
00:03:53,196 --> 00:03:54,476
And as for the vote,

88
00:03:54,796 --> 00:03:55,916
she gave Mr. Tian

89
00:03:55,916 --> 00:03:56,597
full authority.

90
00:03:57,196 --> 00:03:58,397
How can your mom

91
00:03:58,476 --> 00:03:59,437
not tell a friend from foe

92
00:03:59,516 --> 00:04:00,956
or what really matters?

93
00:04:02,196 --> 00:04:03,796
Should I go talk to her?

94
00:04:05,117 --> 00:04:05,997
Don't bother.

95
00:04:06,597 --> 00:04:07,877
Mr. Tian is already acting.

96
00:04:08,476 --> 00:04:09,277
Besides,

97
00:04:10,277 --> 00:04:11,516
let my mom have some peace.

98
00:04:12,117 --> 00:04:13,196
Without my dad,

99
00:04:13,796 --> 00:04:14,837
she feels completely lost.

100
00:04:15,196 --> 00:04:16,077
Is she safe alone?

101
00:04:16,476 --> 00:04:17,197
I checked.

102
00:04:17,397 --> 00:04:18,517
It's just an ordinary inn,

103
00:04:18,757 --> 00:04:20,116
and I paid the owner extra

104
00:04:20,277 --> 00:04:21,436
to look after her safety.

105
00:04:24,996 --> 00:04:26,597
Did Liu Bai forget his key?

106
00:04:30,717 --> 00:04:31,157
Good evening.

107
00:04:31,916 --> 00:04:32,397
Harry?

108
00:04:33,197 --> 00:04:33,796
Why are you here?

109
00:04:34,796 --> 00:04:36,597
I came to deliver
the final cut for review.

110
00:04:36,916 --> 00:04:37,757
I asked Liu Bai,

111
00:04:37,757 --> 00:04:38,676
and he said

112
00:04:38,957 --> 00:04:39,476
you're all here.

113
00:04:40,556 --> 00:04:40,996
Here.

114
00:04:47,556 --> 00:04:47,957
Meng,

115
00:04:49,037 --> 00:04:49,637
what's wrong?

116
00:04:50,996 --> 00:04:51,676
I'm fine.

117
00:04:52,757 --> 00:04:54,197
You're really dedicated,

118
00:04:54,356 --> 00:04:55,876
delivering work material so late.

119
00:04:56,116 --> 00:04:56,676
All done?

120
00:04:56,957 --> 00:04:57,957
I'll drive you home.

121
00:05:01,517 --> 00:05:02,037
Take care.

122
00:05:02,316 --> 00:05:03,077
Bye, then.

123
00:05:03,316 --> 00:05:03,837
Bye.

124
00:05:15,876 --> 00:05:16,397
Xu,

125
00:05:17,476 --> 00:05:18,517
I've been wondering,

126
00:05:19,157 --> 00:05:20,316
how did you

127
00:05:20,597 --> 00:05:21,436
and Meng meet?

128
00:05:22,037 --> 00:05:22,757
What do you think?

129
00:05:23,637 --> 00:05:24,916
Well,

130
00:05:26,236 --> 00:05:26,957
whenever Meng talks

131
00:05:26,957 --> 00:05:27,916
about her husband,

132
00:05:28,556 --> 00:05:29,397
she looks so happy.

133
00:05:29,837 --> 00:05:30,316
So

134
00:05:31,077 --> 00:05:31,637
she probably

135
00:05:31,717 --> 00:05:32,517
isn't your client.

136
00:05:33,476 --> 00:05:34,837
Haven't you met her husband?

137
00:05:35,236 --> 00:05:35,796
No.

138
00:05:41,445 --> 00:05:45,058
(Take pills)

139
00:05:52,197 --> 00:05:53,077
That's a lot of pills.

140
00:05:53,676 --> 00:05:54,637
Are you feeling sick?

141
00:05:57,116 --> 00:05:57,957
Just vitamins,

142
00:05:58,316 --> 00:05:59,517
lutein, fish oil, and stuff.

143
00:05:59,717 --> 00:06:00,356
In that case,

144
00:06:00,717 --> 00:06:01,676
give me a lutein pill

145
00:06:01,717 --> 00:06:02,277
for my eyes.

146
00:06:02,556 --> 00:06:03,197
Sorry,

147
00:06:03,356 --> 00:06:04,277
I'm out of lutein.

148
00:06:10,996 --> 00:06:11,556
Sorry.

149
00:06:11,876 --> 00:06:12,916
The light just turned red.

150
00:06:13,676 --> 00:06:14,236
No problem.

151
00:06:23,876 --> 00:06:24,356
Xu,

152
00:06:24,597 --> 00:06:25,356
just drop me off

153
00:06:25,356 --> 00:06:26,116
at the next corner.

154
00:06:26,277 --> 00:06:27,116
I live nearby.

155
00:06:28,837 --> 00:06:29,236
Sure.

156
00:06:37,356 --> 00:06:37,837
Bye, Xu.

157
00:07:02,157 --> 00:07:02,717
Hey, buddy,

158
00:07:03,316 --> 00:07:04,796
use your medical expertise

159
00:07:04,916 --> 00:07:05,996
and see what pills they are.

160
00:07:06,356 --> 00:07:07,236
I need it for a case.

161
00:07:07,476 --> 00:07:07,876
Thanks.

162
00:07:24,957 --> 00:07:26,517
Mr. Tian, can we have a word?

163
00:07:26,757 --> 00:07:27,277
Go on in.

164
00:07:27,916 --> 00:07:28,757
Of course, Mr. Di.

165
00:07:28,757 --> 00:07:29,197
What's wrong?

166
00:07:29,316 --> 00:07:29,837
Mr. Tian,

167
00:07:30,236 --> 00:07:31,556
why did you abstain?

168
00:07:31,957 --> 00:07:32,397
Hello.

169
00:07:33,197 --> 00:07:33,676
Meng,

170
00:07:34,397 --> 00:07:35,037
well,

171
00:07:35,517 --> 00:07:36,556
I thought about it

172
00:07:36,996 --> 00:07:37,957
and felt it was wrong.

173
00:07:38,356 --> 00:07:39,556
These are critical times.

174
00:07:39,996 --> 00:07:41,597
Your mom couldn't take the shock

175
00:07:41,597 --> 00:07:43,112
and went up the mountain to meditate.

176
00:07:43,837 --> 00:07:45,397
I don't want her to think

177
00:07:45,796 --> 00:07:46,397
I'm trying

178
00:07:46,556 --> 00:07:48,116
to make a move on Jiali

179
00:07:48,916 --> 00:07:50,077
while your father is sick.

180
00:07:50,397 --> 00:07:51,077
Excuse me.

181
00:07:52,316 --> 00:07:53,397
Liren can handle it.

182
00:07:53,676 --> 00:07:54,436
He's capable.

183
00:07:54,916 --> 00:07:55,277
Mr. Tian,

184
00:07:55,556 --> 00:07:56,077
shall we go in?

185
00:07:56,277 --> 00:07:56,637
Okay.

186
00:07:57,197 --> 00:07:57,517
Let's go.

187
00:07:58,037 --> 00:07:58,397
After you.

188
00:07:58,796 --> 00:08:00,277
Thank you all for coming.

189
00:08:01,556 --> 00:08:02,757
Today is this year's second

190
00:08:02,757 --> 00:08:03,436
shareholder meeting

191
00:08:03,517 --> 00:08:04,397
of Jiali Cosmetics.

192
00:08:05,277 --> 00:08:06,837
I'll first read the agenda.

193
00:08:07,236 --> 00:08:07,916
Item one,

194
00:08:08,717 --> 00:08:09,397
the shareholder vote.

195
00:08:09,796 --> 00:08:11,116
Based on the vote,

196
00:08:11,757 --> 00:08:12,597
we'll decide on the spot

197
00:08:12,996 --> 00:08:14,637
who receives interim signing authority

198
00:08:14,996 --> 00:08:15,837
for Jiali Cosmetics

199
00:08:16,236 --> 00:08:17,436
while Mr. Yu Jianguo recovers.

200
00:08:21,277 --> 00:08:21,717
(Agenda Item One)

201
00:08:21,717 --> 00:08:22,397
One vote for Lin Yue.

202
00:08:23,316 --> 00:08:24,157
One vote for Zheng Mengqi.

203
00:08:25,397 --> 00:08:26,197
One vote for Lin Zhihua.

204
00:08:27,717 --> 00:08:28,597
One vote for Di Liren.

205
00:08:29,556 --> 00:08:30,397
One vote for Lin Zhihua.

206
00:08:31,916 --> 00:08:32,676
One vote for Di Liren.

207
00:08:33,997 --> 00:08:34,716
One vote for Di Liren.

208
00:08:38,997 --> 00:08:40,196
The voting result is clear.

209
00:08:40,556 --> 00:08:41,157
I hereby announce

210
00:08:41,676 --> 00:08:43,357
that while Mr. Yu Jianguo recuperates,

211
00:08:43,676 --> 00:08:45,397
signing authority for Jiali Cosmetics

212
00:08:45,637 --> 00:08:47,556
will be held by Mr. Di Liren.

213
00:08:48,157 --> 00:08:49,076
Mr. Di, please say something.

214
00:08:59,956 --> 00:09:00,397
Thank you.

215
00:09:00,956 --> 00:09:01,836
Thank you, shareholders,

216
00:09:02,196 --> 00:09:03,397
for your trust and support.

217
00:09:03,796 --> 00:09:05,596
I'll keep pushing forward as always

218
00:09:06,196 --> 00:09:06,757
to lead Jiali

219
00:09:07,117 --> 00:09:08,757
to break new ground in the domestic

220
00:09:09,477 --> 00:09:10,237
cosmetics market.

221
00:09:11,436 --> 00:09:12,237
I won't let down

222
00:09:12,556 --> 00:09:14,117
my father-in-law, Mr. Yu Jianguo.

223
00:09:14,836 --> 00:09:15,397
Everyone,

224
00:09:16,477 --> 00:09:18,556
I am Mr. Yu Jianguo's attorney.

225
00:09:18,916 --> 00:09:19,997
He has retained me

226
00:09:20,157 --> 00:09:21,076
for over 20 years.

227
00:09:21,477 --> 00:09:22,556
I believe everyone here

228
00:09:22,716 --> 00:09:23,357
knows who I am.

229
00:09:23,836 --> 00:09:24,596
I'm here today

230
00:09:25,037 --> 00:09:27,157
to read an authorization letter

231
00:09:27,757 --> 00:09:29,357
that he had notarized before his coma.

232
00:09:35,757 --> 00:09:36,916
While Mr. Yu Jianguo

233
00:09:36,956 --> 00:09:38,477
is incapacitated,

234
00:09:39,076 --> 00:09:40,477
signing authority for Jiali Cosmetics

235
00:09:41,157 --> 00:09:42,997
belongs solely to Ms. Yu Meng.

236
00:09:49,436 --> 00:09:49,916
Mr. Li,

237
00:09:51,076 --> 00:09:52,477
right after Mr. Yu fell into a coma,

238
00:09:52,637 --> 00:09:53,556
I asked you about this

239
00:09:53,596 --> 00:09:54,196
right away.

240
00:09:54,676 --> 00:09:55,877
You said he left nothing behind.

241
00:09:56,117 --> 00:09:57,277
I have reason to question

242
00:09:57,277 --> 00:09:58,037
the validity

243
00:09:58,037 --> 00:09:58,836
of the authorization

244
00:09:59,157 --> 00:10:00,157
you just produced.

245
00:10:01,877 --> 00:10:03,357
Worried about shifting circumstances,

246
00:10:03,916 --> 00:10:04,877
Mr. Yu instructed me

247
00:10:05,277 --> 00:10:06,956
to read this authorization only

248
00:10:06,997 --> 00:10:08,196
before a full assembly

249
00:10:08,397 --> 00:10:09,997
of Jiali's shareholders.

250
00:10:10,117 --> 00:10:10,916
Furthermore,

251
00:10:11,517 --> 00:10:13,316
because his coma was sudden,

252
00:10:13,836 --> 00:10:14,757
I needed time

253
00:10:14,836 --> 00:10:15,916
to finish the legal process.

254
00:10:16,556 --> 00:10:17,076
As soon

255
00:10:17,436 --> 00:10:18,237
as it was done,

256
00:10:18,357 --> 00:10:19,556
I brought it straight here.

257
00:10:20,436 --> 00:10:21,316
This notarization

258
00:10:22,316 --> 00:10:23,196
is open to review.

259
00:10:29,037 --> 00:10:29,716
Ms. Yu,

260
00:10:30,997 --> 00:10:31,477
congrats.

261
00:10:34,357 --> 00:10:35,556
I'll continue to serve

262
00:10:35,716 --> 00:10:36,517
Mr. Yu faithfully.

263
00:10:36,517 --> 00:10:37,037
Thank you,

264
00:10:37,517 --> 00:10:38,076
Mr. Li.

265
00:10:44,489 --> 00:10:46,248
(Yu Jianguo)

266
00:11:01,836 --> 00:11:02,757
This is my first day

267
00:11:02,757 --> 00:11:03,877
with signing authority at Jiali.

268
00:11:04,277 --> 00:11:05,037
I hope

269
00:11:05,517 --> 00:11:06,637
this is only the beginning.

270
00:11:06,997 --> 00:11:08,796
I'll do my duty

271
00:11:09,556 --> 00:11:10,796
and own the responsibility.

272
00:11:11,757 --> 00:11:12,757
I will do everything

273
00:11:12,796 --> 00:11:13,796
in my power

274
00:11:14,397 --> 00:11:15,196
to get Jiali

275
00:11:15,716 --> 00:11:16,556
back on track.

276
00:11:34,956 --> 00:11:35,637
Come in.

277
00:11:41,397 --> 00:11:42,477
These are from Mr. Di.

278
00:11:42,596 --> 00:11:43,477
He heard you've been

279
00:11:43,477 --> 00:11:44,637
signing papers all morning

280
00:11:44,836 --> 00:11:45,757
and was really worried.

281
00:11:49,637 --> 00:11:51,397
He's just using concern

282
00:11:51,596 --> 00:11:52,237
as an excuse

283
00:11:52,277 --> 00:11:53,397
to rush me.

284
00:11:54,517 --> 00:11:55,397
You came just in time.

285
00:11:55,676 --> 00:11:57,157
I've reviewed these files.

286
00:11:58,477 --> 00:11:59,436
However,

287
00:12:00,877 --> 00:12:01,556
I cannot sign this.

288
00:12:03,588 --> 00:12:04,008
(Jiangzhou Jiali Cosmetics)

289
00:12:04,008 --> 00:12:04,485
(Application for Jinghua Series
Production Expansion)

290
00:12:10,237 --> 00:12:12,196
Additional production order for Jinghua

291
00:12:12,436 --> 00:12:13,517
is an internal decision

292
00:12:13,556 --> 00:12:14,357
made by the company.

293
00:12:15,477 --> 00:12:16,676
How can Meng refuse to sign

294
00:12:16,676 --> 00:12:17,517
on a whim?

295
00:12:18,117 --> 00:12:19,556
Did she tell you

296
00:12:19,556 --> 00:12:20,436
beforehand?

297
00:12:21,477 --> 00:12:21,997
